WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.330
Come find me!

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:12.160
Come find me!

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.160
Seven Years Ago,
Restoration Year 100

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.160
Guys! I said to come find me...

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.700
Where did everyone go to hide?

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:28.870
Come find me! Come find me!

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:00.700
Wait!

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.660
You can do it, Iori. Today is...

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:38.830
Iori Minase and Prometheus 2,
Nebula, deploy!

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.830
S.O.S. kikoeta

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:46.790
Yatto anata ni kikoeta?

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.750
Kakko kawaiku ne

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.290
Fujun, junsui, dotchi no character?

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.120
Onaji na no kashira

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.660
Love beat ga sokudo zenkai

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.660
Kizuita, kore wa tokubetsu na mission... Wakatta

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:23.080
Honki misechau yo, kanaechau kara

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.950
Sora o tsukinuketa sekai de

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:33.870
Fushigi na omoi kanjita yo, shunkan de suki!

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:38.950
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:42.290
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:47.870
Naiteta chiisa na watashi ga tachimukau

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:50.200
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.500
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:53.500 --> 00:03:01.580
Binetsu na kibun wa anata no sei kamo, s.o.s.!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:14.620
Hard to Move, Somehow

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.660
One final test?

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:13.540
Yup.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:21.700
It's to see whether or not Iori Minase is fit
to pilot the Nebula as an Idolmaster.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:22.950
This is her last chance.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.910
But it's hardly necessary

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:28.950
to designate setting up the early-warning
satellite as her test.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:32.700
Think the Drops will wait to fall
when it's convenient for us?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.290
And one more thing.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:39.120
We're fitting the Nebula with some
new equipment just in from Geneva.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.620
New equipment?

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.950
Yeah, the device is called a Master Unison.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.290
What precisely is that?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:51.910
Well, just think of it as
something like a data logger.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.700
I was under the impression
Miss Miura knew about it.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.290
Looking at our overall schedule,
we're right on time.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.790
The Nebula has entered orbit
around the Earth.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:17.290
Incoming notice from Tanegashima.
Plans to fire the rockets remain unchanged.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.660
It's time to launch the satellite.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.580
Wow, that's amazing!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.660
I've verified that the launch was successful.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.160
It is scheduled to rendezvous
with the Nebula in 600 seconds.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.660
Chikako, how are things on your end?

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.120
We've got a good connection
with the Nebula through our remote link.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.500
We're problem-free here!

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.040
Ami?

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.620
I am on standby.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:46.660
I'm tracing all of Iori and
Nebula's data from here.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:50.700
In other words,
relax and do your thing, Iori!

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.870
Okay. Thank you for your assistance.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:56.160
Iori, hang in there...

00:04:56.410 --> 00:05:02.160
Oh, Minase. I know this is getting
redundant, but this is your last chance.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.910
Please bear that in mind as you
carry out this mission.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:08.290
Sir! I swear this mission will be a success!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:38.200
We will finish transferring the data
from Riffa momentarily.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.410
Once the mass production Epimetheus
models are ready, put a unit together.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:46.000
Also draw up plans for
our assault on Mondenkind.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:47.410
Very well.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.830
How is Hiems?

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:53.040
On schedule. It should become mobile
before much longer.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.250
I see...

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:59.620
We possess Nubilum and Hiems.
Mondenkind has Imber and Nebula.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:05.250
Once Tempestas, the last one remaining,
enters the scene, Aulyn will finally open up.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:08.620
Mother will most certainly be pleased.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.250
Next!

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.250
Focus Five and Focus Six
have been eliminated.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.160
I've confirmed that all obstacles obstructing

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.000
the satellite's orbital path
have been cleared.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.500
It's currently approaching
the satellite cluster.

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:55.500
And Iori's condition?

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:58.450
Both her simulcast and vitals look good.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.040
Nothing seems amiss.
This is a good operation.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:02.870
Forehead...

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.410
All of her hard work while
on probation has paid off, huh?

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:08.200
Indeed.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.000
Satellite No. 1 is ready for launch.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.290
I will now fire it into orbit.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.290
The mission is transitioning to Phase 4.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.910
Nebula, commence countdown to fire.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.410
Thirty seconds until you fire the satellite.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:48.910
29 seconds,

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:52.080
28, 27, 26,

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.120
25, 24...

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.250
Haruka...
25, 24...

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.790
It's finally happening, Iori!

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:01.540
It's no coincidence that I'm getting
this chance today; it was predestined.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.830
I've got to do my best!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:10.450
Today's our anniversary.
For Nebula and me.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.830
An anniversary?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.250
It's nothing!

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.700
Satellite No. 1 has been launched.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.870
I will begin preparing
to launch Satellite No. 2.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:33.200
And then you lost your chance
to ask her what she meant?

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.290
Yeah...

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.330
Nebula is launching Satellite No. 2.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.330
It is entering its designated orbit.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.950
We're receiving messages
from the relevant organizations.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.330
They are picking up signals
from the satellites.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.830
Verifying that the Drop Early-Warning
System is functional.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:01.160
Systems: All green! The mission is over.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.660
Sweet!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.160
We didn't even need to use No. 3,
which was our backup!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.750
"All's well that ends well," or so they say.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.500
Okay, very good.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:15.750
Minase, job well done.
Your exam is now over.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.160
You conducted the operation wonderfully.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:20.410
It was a delicate operation
and you completed it perfectly.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.750
I couldn't want for more
from Nebula's Master.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.120
What do you say, Ma'am?

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.950
Iori Minase.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:38.790
Ma'am!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.040
I have decided that you are
the one most worthy

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.790
to serve as Master for
Prometheus 2, Nebula.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:50.290
Therefore, as of this moment, I renew
your appointment as Nebula's Master.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.370
She did it!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.660
Congratulations.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.200
Am I really...?

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:15.200
Job well done, Iori.
You've worked hard, haven't you?

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:19.870
Nebula...

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:22.870
I did it! I did!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.250
Now then, let's move on to the main act.

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:38.450
What happened?!
What's the matter, Nebula?

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:43.700
He's locked?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.000
Master Unison...?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.080
What's wrong, Nebula? What happened?!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.250
What is that? What on Earth
is Master Unison?

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.330
Nebula?!

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:08.700
Nebula has taken position
to fire the spare satellite.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.950
Our signals are being repelled!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:16.120
Iori, the mission is over.
What do you think you're doing?

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.620
It isn't me! It's Nebula!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.660
Nebula is moving on his own!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.700
Stop it, Nebula!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:36.580
I've confirmed that they fired
Satellite No. 3. It's entering orbit.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.000
Everyone, please calm yourselves.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:45.290
Listen to me, Iori. Nebula is currently
being controlled by the Master Unison.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.450
It is part of this mission.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:53.290
What is the meaning of this, Chief?
I never heard about this.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:56.250
Allow me to explain, sir.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:12:00.950
You see, everything from here out is part
of our second objective for this mission.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.910
It's for the Master Unison.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:07.910
For the Master Unison? But you said
it was merely a data logger!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:14.410
Right. It teaches an A.I. the data needed
to make the iDOL autonomous.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:18.120
Autonomous? Headquarters
never mentioned this...

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:21.620
Yeah, they're just late in informing you!

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:23.950
You have my apologies, sir.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:31.160
Um, Azusa? Why would
we need something like that?

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.700
You already have us Masters...

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:38.660
It's because of Epimetheus.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:41.910
As a countermeasure,

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.910
even Mondenkind's Geneva Headquarters

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.080
decided to invest in
the autonomous system

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:48.750
that had already undergone development.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.870
That would be Master Unison.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.370
But then-

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:57.040
Then does that mean the Master Unison
will pilot our iDOLs from now on?

00:12:57.450 --> 00:13:00.120
Are we done piloting the iDOLs?!

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:06.500
I didn't say that. This device is meant
to protect you Masters from harm.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:07.790
But-!

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:12.250
I apologize for not mentioning this earlier.
But this isn't up for debate.

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.370
The satellite you just launched

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:17.410
will also serve to get a grasp
on Turiavita's movements.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:21.700
The bigwigs ordered me not to tell
anyone about this beforehand.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:26.450
Well, that just shows how high up the
politicians who approved this mission were.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.540
This dumb machine...

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.120
Damn you!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.750
What's going on? This came from nowhere!

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:43.790
I can't stop it!

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.040
Hey, now! What's going on?!

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:46.500
System error?!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.500
What's the matter?
System error?!

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.540
What gives?! Jeez!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.250
Is this my fault? Because I hit the machine?

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.790
Of course not!

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.410
Forehead, these abnormalities
aren't your fault.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:57.540
The control mechanism froze.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:00.290
I've prioritized sending it
compulsory commands,

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.000
but the system isn't responding!

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.290
It's Nebula! Nebula doesn't like the system!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.910
He's saying, "I don't like the
Master Unison! I hate it!"

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.620
What?! There's no way it could-

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:15.200
Break his connection to the Master Unison
and return control of the Nebula to Iori.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:19.250
The commands have been locked!
He isn't accepting commands from here!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.200
Nebula!

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.160
There are several errors
in the route system!

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:34.910
The internal temperature inside
Nebula's core is rapidly increasing!

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.000
Activate emergency coolant!

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:38.250
It's inoperable! I'm not getting a response!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.250
He's rejecting the system.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:44.450
Nebula is having an allergic reaction
to the Master Unison.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:45.950
His temperature is still rising!

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:50.200
He's currently at 500ºC, 550ºC...
He's over 600ºC!

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:55.080
Blow the explosive bolts! We're separating
Master Unison from Nebula.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.080
Is that acceptable?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:57.910
Huh? Wait, but-

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.580
Transmitting the command to jettison!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.790
It isn't working!
He's rejecting our commands.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:06.910
We're unable to separate them!

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.950
The core's internal temperature
is over 800ºC.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.040
If it continues to increase,

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.790
there is a possibility that it will destroy

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:18.160
the silicon dendrite's personalized
identity patterning structure.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:21.370
I don't get that! Say it in Japanese!

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.660
Nebula could lose all of
his memories and experiences

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.580
that help to form his personality.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:30.790
This couldn't destroy the actual core,
which is the iDOL's real body.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:34.580
But if his temperature rises to over 1,000ºC,

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.370
the personality that we consider
"Nebula" will cease to exist!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.500
He'll vanish...?

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:50.660
That isn't funny!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.410
There is no way you're going
to forget about me!

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:56.870
I won't let that happen!

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:58.870
Forehead, what are you going to do?!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:02.910
Long story short, I just have to break off
that lame piece of trash.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:04.410
I'm going outside.

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:08.910
Listen to yourself, Iori! You're surrounded
by the vacuum of outer space.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.620
That's why I have a space suit!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:12.580
You're such a moron!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:13.950
I've secured a line with the outer cameras.
You're such a moron!

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.450
I'm putting it on the main monitor!

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:22.750
Iori...

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.120
Forehead...

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:43.950
Stop it right now! None of our Masters
possess EVA licenses!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.790
Note: EVA is an abbreviation for "Extravehicular
activity" in space.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:45.580
Return to your cockpit immediately!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.000
Please let her try!

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:48.540
Miss Akizuki?!

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:50.160
I'm begging you, Ma'am!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.370
I'm asking you as well.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.330
We've got to stand steadfast.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.620
Listen, Forehead.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.160
The manual switch for
the explosive bolts is located

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.870
under the Master Unison's main body.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:06.660
You need to activate them!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.500
Sure thing!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.580
The core's internal temperature
has reached 900ºC!

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:17.410
Start with the cable connections.
The switch is right next to them.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.250
After you remove them,
open the ignition plug next to that.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.620
You'll be done once you push down
the lever that comes out.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.370
We're running out of time. Hurry!

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:32.120
I'll do my best, so you have to show me
what you've got, Nebula!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:37.370
There is no way we're changing our special
day to the anniversary of your death!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:42.950
You see, today is the anniversary
of the day we first met.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.700
I guess you may not...

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.250
...remember it, but...

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.620
On that fateful day seven years ago, I was
playing hide-and-seek with my friends.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.450
That's when you appeared before me.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:58.120
But no one believed me.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.080
Since I was the only one who saw you,

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.660
everyone said I must have
dreamed the whole thing up.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.910
Daydreaming Iori!

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.040
You sure you didn't pick up some
weird signals through your forehead?

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:16.120
She fell asleep and had a dream
during the day! Forehead Iori!

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.040
Forehead, Forehead!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:29.370
But then I got scouted by Mondenkind
and I got to see you once more.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:37.660
I seriously thought that you appeared from
the mist on that day to guide me to you!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:41.700
It was a coincidence that you
appeared before me.

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:46.500
But if we hadn't met then,
I wouldn't be the person I am now!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.790
If this isn't fate, I don't know what is!

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.330
I will never forget you!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:56.620
So I will never let you forget about me,
no matter what!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.160
It isn't activating?

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:07.660
Why not?! Move, damn it! You stupid-!

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.450
The core's internal temperature
is over 1,000ºC.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.250
Iori!

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.750
Forehead, hurry!

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.540
Get off of him, you dumb-!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:21.250
I finally became Nebula's Master!
Now we can finally be together!

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:24.950
I won't let you get in our way!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.580
I won't let you stand
in the way of our future.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.660
That's why...

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:38.000
...you're getting off my Nebula!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.000
Master Unison has detached!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.450
We've regained control of Nebula!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.120
Commencing emergency cooling.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:02.410
The core's temperature is dropping fast.
600ºC... 550ºC!

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:05.660
You can rest at ease. Nebula'll be okay.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:20.200
I did it...?

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.120
Eh?!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.410
Y-you really broke your arm?

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.950
She sure did! Right in half.

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:43.120
Seriously, can you believe this girl? Really!

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:44.370
What's this?

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:49.410
I always take things seriously.
More importantly, what's with all that?

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:53.200
I thought we needed to celebrate
since today was your anniversary.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:21:00.200
I-I see no need for Idiot Ribbon
to celebrate for me! Besides...

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.410
That's MINE!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.620
Shut up!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.200
What is THIS doing here?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:08.410
I figured the more lively the party the better.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:11.200
What? That's no reason
to invite this D-rank-

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:17.290
I wasted my precious day off
to come here, so don't complain!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.250
But yer aw'ways off worhh!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.000
What?!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.370
You juhh came fer fhe free foog,
dimm't you?!

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:22.830
Silence!

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.080
That hurts, moron!

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.540
That costume is cheating!

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:30.450
Iori,
Congrats

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:29.910
Hey, hold it!

00:21:56.200 --> 00:22:05.160
Toki o wataru seija no you ni

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:14.120
Donna kodoku ni naite ita no?

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:23.000
Haruka tooi hoshi o tsunagi

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:31.540
Ne, omoi o egaku wa, sora o miagete

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:43.000
Dear boy, itsumo kokoro ni anata o sagaseba

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:51.950
Ah, dakishimeru hodo ni tsuyoi hikari o hanatsu no

00:22:51.950 --> 00:23:00.910
Mabataku kidou ga futari no mejirushi

00:23:00.910 --> 00:23:12.540
Ima doko de mite ite mo truth kanjitete

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:33.290
Preview
Hangar Heaven

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.290
Good evening. It's Yayoi!

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:31.290
So, Mondenkind must face a massive
problem in the next episode!

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:33.290
How will Haruka and the others respond?

00:23:33.290 --> 00:23:40.870
Preview
Hangar Heaven

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:37.500
Next time on Idolm@ster Xenoglossia,
put your heart on standby!

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.120
Sometimes I totally nail my lines!
